<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Plessey renews cautionary on negotiations.</title>
<headline>Plessey renews cautionary on negotiations.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics group Plessey Corp Ltd on Monday renewed a cautionary first issued on February 7, saying it was still in talks which could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings but gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
